1
00:00:00,763 --> 00:00:02,093
...like you're 9 years old?

2
00:00:02,848 --> 00:00:06,388
(Howard:)-You live with your mother?
-No. That's the sad part.

3
00:00:07,603 --> 00:00:09,853
(Howard:)Rough. Okay, check this out.

4
00:00:10,022 --> 00:00:12,612
(Howard:)My mother made me wear rubber gloves
to kindergarten...

5
00:00:12,775 --> 00:00:15,905
(Howard:)...so I wouldn't pick up a disease
from the other children.

6
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,280
(Bernadette:)That's nothing.
I couldn't ride a bicycle...

7
00:00:18,489 --> 00:00:21,909
...because my mother was afraid
I'd hit a bump and lose my virginity.

8
00:00:22,993 --> 00:00:25,243
(Howard:)Oh, wow, you didn't, did you?

9
00:00:25,454 --> 00:00:28,954
(Bernadette:)Not on a bicycle. In a Camry.

10
00:00:31,669 --> 00:00:32,999
A Corolla.

11
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,300
[BOTH CHUCKLE]

12
00:00:34,505 --> 00:00:36,085
(Howard:)-More wine?
-I'd love some.

13
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,880
(Howard:)Listen, you have to come
to Shabbat dinner at my house sometime.

14
00:00:40,052 --> 00:00:41,092
(Leonard:)Why?

15
00:00:41,261 --> 00:00:44,011
(Howard:)A Catholic girl like you
wearing a big cross like that...

16
00:00:44,181 --> 00:00:47,851
(Howard:)...might just give my mother the big
brain aneurysm I've been hoping for.

17
00:00:50,354 --> 00:00:55,194
(Bernadette:)Okay, but only if you come to Sunday
dinner at my house wearing a yarmulke.

18
00:00:55,609 --> 00:00:58,019
(Howard:)It's a date.

